WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.183
Did you know nearly one in two Black heritage donors have a blood subtype called Ro?

2
00:00:07.483 --> 00:00:12.545
It's rare in the wider population, and many people with sickle cell need it.

3
00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:17.348
Sickle cell is an inherited condition that affects red blood cells.

4
00:00:17.648 --> 00:00:23.551
In Nigeria, at least 150,000 babies are born with it every year.

5
00:00:23.851 --> 00:00:27.667
In the UK, about 19,000 people live with it.

6
00:00:27.867 --> 00:00:33.113
Yet just three in every hundred blood donors are from Black communities.

7
00:00:33.413 --> 00:00:37.716
Check if you can give blood. Your local service is on screen.

8
00:00:38.016 --> 00:00:43.865
As Black History Month ends, history is made by people who show up for each other.

9
00:00:44.065 --> 00:00:46.746
Have you given blood? Tell us below,

10
00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:52.119
and follow the Igbo Healthcare Professionals Network, IHPN-UK.
